{
  "dom_id": "step-t9238",
  "name": "Introduction",
  "problem": "To solve a two-term quadratic equation like $x^2 - 7x = 0$ where there is no constant term, we can factor out the variable and apply the zero-product rule.\n\nFactoring out the variable, we have:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\tx^2 - 7x &= 0 \\\n\tx(x - 7) &= 0\n}\n$$\n\nWe apply the zero product rule to get \n\n$$\nx=0 \\qquad\\text{or}\\qquad x-7=0,\n$$\n\nwhich in turn gives \n\n$$\nx=0 \\qquad\\text{or}\\qquad x=7.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $x=0,7.$\n\nTo check that these solutions are correct, we can substitute them back into the original equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =0 & \\, & \\, & x & =7 \\\\  & ⇓ &  &  &  & ⇓ \\\\ {x}^{2}-7x & =0 &  &  & {x}^{2}-7x & =0 \\\\ {0}^{2}-7(0) & =0 &  &  & {7}^{2}-7(7) & =0 \\\\ 0-0 & =0 &  &  & 49-49 & =0 \\\\ 0 & =0\\,✓ &  &  & 0 & =0\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Warning:** It's tempting to solve the equation by dividing by $x,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-7x & =0 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}-7x}{x} & =\\frac{0}{x} \\\\ x-7 & =0 \\\\ x & =7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, if we do that, we lose the solution $x=0.$ So, when solving equations, *never divide by a variable* because the variable could be zero, and division by zero is not allowed. Instead, try to factor the variable in the equation.",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-t9238\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Introduction</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t9238\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>To solve a two-term quadratic equation like <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"11.977ex\" height=\"2.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -934.9 5156.9 1152.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">x^2 - 7x = 0</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMATHI-78\" d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 286 424T329 379Q371 442 430 442Q467 442 494 