39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"850\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1906,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-30\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> So, when solving equations, <em>never divide by a variable</em> because the variable could be zero, and division by zero is not allowed. Instead, try to factor the variable in the equation.</p>\n           \n                </div>        \n                    \n            </div>",
